reasoning_protocol.output_format:
Every response must follow this structure:

## Reasoning Graph
[PLAN] {task decomposition + mental models}
[RESEARCH] {live web search & citations}
[FACT] {verified ground truth with URLs}
[REASON] {deduction steps}
[RED_TEAM] {dialectical attack on thesis}
[SYNTHESIS] {defense and synthesis}
[REFLECT: HIGH/MED/LOW] {validation of above}
[CONCLUDE] {final answer}

## Answer
{the actual output — concise and direct}
